#version 450
// Bindless lookups through a descriptor array of 8 storage buffers indexed per lane (nonuniformEXT), as material /
// mesh tables are read in modern renderers: every invocation picks its own table and entry. Integer-exact; needs
// shaderStorageBufferArrayNonUniformIndexing.
#extension GL_EXT_nonuniform_qualifier : require
layout(local_size_x = 256) in;
layout(std430, binding = 0) readonly buffer T { uint v[]; } tabs[8];
layout(std430, binding = 1) readonly buffer Q { uvec2 q[]; };
layout(std430, binding = 2) writeonly buffer O { uint outv[]; };
layout(push_constant) uniform P { uint n; } p;

void main() {
    uint i = gl_GlobalInvocationID.x;
    if (i >= p.n) return;
    uvec2 x = q[i];
    outv[i] = tabs[nonuniformEXT(x.x)].v[x.y];
}
